    `<p>Blaze is taking a breather! Score: ${G.score}</p><p>You reached ${Math.floor(G.maxAlt)}m of ${cfg().goal}m.</p>`,
    '🔥 Fire Safety: Never give up — try the climb again!',
    '↻ TRY AGAIN',()=>{G.score=G.startScore;initLevel(G.level);G.state='play';});
