       piece on next boot.
     - Unlock celebration overlay on each piece earned.
     - window.__FB_BRONZE_ARMOR exposes the set for other readers.
   Touches: Game.checkEnd (chained). DOM overlay only. No canvas,
     combat, or baseline changes.
